Cell["\<\
If all three side measures converge to uniform measures on their limiting \
straight segments, their average converges to the corresponding triangle \
measure. This gives equal mass to each side; it equals normalized perimeter \
length only when the three side lengths agree.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2f5af0f6-a44b-4b77-99b4-ba3b7046c410"],

Cell["\<\
The triangle asks whether several emerging lines fit together in the same \
drawing. Aligning its base fixes two corners; the position of the third \
remains an observed part of its shape.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c2dae69f-e655-4371-8e22-5d7983f776f1"],

